Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.06,0:02:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《鬼娃回魂3》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是安迪·巴克利\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Andy Barclay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八年前  他引发的一起事件\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight years ago,he touched off the scandal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差点使公司倒闭\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that nearly crippled this company,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,声称他的好家伙玩偶  恰吉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}claiming that his Good Guy doll, Chucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.16,0:04:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被查尔斯·李·雷附身\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was possessed by Charles Lee Ray,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个声名狼藉的湖畔杀人犯\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the notorious Lakeshore Strangler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,征求意见  女士们和先生们\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I ask you,ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在所有的诉讼和负面言论之后\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after all the lawsuits and negative publicity,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:36.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公司最终决定恢复生产这个"好家伙"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the company is finally getting back on its feet again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨论一下此产品推回到市场有何明智之举  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where is the wisdom in putting the Good Guy back on the market?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙利文先生  在事件发生之前\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sullivan,before any of this happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"好家伙"娃娃的销量是其他娃娃的两倍\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Good Guy outsold all our other toys 2-to-I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:51.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使现在  市场的需求兴趣点也是在最巅峰\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even now, interest in the market place is at its peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工厂已经进入再次量产阶段\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The factory is up and running again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下周之前产品应进入各大商店\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should be in stores by next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:05:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能让一个有"恐慌症"的孩子\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot let the fantasies of one disturbed boy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来影响了公司的效益\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}influence company policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有  如果这种娃娃以消极的方式\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what if the doll somehow affects
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影响了其他的孩子\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}another child in a negative way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你心里可能就会有一种无法摆脱的公共梦魇\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have a public relations nightmare on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道  这笔生意最难过的坎\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, one of the hardest things about this business
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这是一笔生意\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that it is a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们卖什么并不重要\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter what we're selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:27.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论是汽车  核武器  甚至是玩具\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether it's cars,nuclear weapons, or, yes, even toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题的关键在于\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bottom line is the bottom line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们算什么  毕竟  还是新生消费者\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are children,after all,but consumer trainees
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安迪·巴克利已经成为历史\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andy Barclay is ancient history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:46.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人记得他  没人关注他\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one remembers him. Nobody cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经决定\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:55.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要继续向前发展\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're moving ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的  - 好的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙利文先生\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sullivan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若没之前的事  我会全力支持你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's nothing I can say to convince you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我现在必须要表明我的立场\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then I must go on record with my position.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常反对这样做\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm completely against this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的立场已经很清楚了  迈尔斯\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your position is crystal clear, Miles,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:13.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道我也不会忘记历史的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you can be sure I won't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友们  稍等一下\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute, folks! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙利文先生  有个小惊喜\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sullivan, we have a little surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工厂那边送来的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guys at the factory sent this over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都希望你会收下它\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we all wanted you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是第一个下线的产品\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the first one off the assembly line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.28,0:06:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,90年代的"好家伙"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Good Guy of the '90s!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  如果没事了  我要撤了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if there's nothing  else,I'm gonna get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:48.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是  我老婆在等我呢\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just,my wife's expecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.20,0:06:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是结婚周年日\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  佩佐德\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, Petzold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.96,0:06:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想  晚餐之后重新仔细研究下市场调研报告\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess I could review the Larrabee report after dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:07:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安  沙利文先生\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night,Mr. Sullivan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:02.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管股市趋势疲软\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, despite a downdraft in the bond market,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各大股东依然会迅速重整旗鼓\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stocks were able to post a rally on Friday,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里要感谢各大工厂的鼎力相助\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thanks to a couple of different factors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强于预期的就业报告\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only did the stronger-than-expected employment report
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:08.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅减轻了经济的衰退\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}allay some recession fears,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且使部分个股出现技术性反弹\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but also there was a technical rebound in stock,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空头回补  持续买进\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}short covering, program buying,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:13.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且帮助了在个股交易中\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the resurgence in the deal stocks
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,资金的回转和定下私募起点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}help set the tone for rally on the Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面我们看一下数据\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a look at the numbers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本周五  道琼斯指数提升了16个百分点占比三分之二\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Friday, the Dow Industrial's up sixteen and two-thirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日涨幅最高点中\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of the highs of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其交易量稍好一点  要比同期提升三倍\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the transportation average up a little better than three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公共事业股涨幅均为  12点  22点  61点  78点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Utilities bouncing up a point to pass at 12, at22, 61, 78.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,S&P  500指数显示交易峰值多达两个\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S&P 500 Cash are better than two
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同比增高了接近2  5倍\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the margin peaking up almost two and a half
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.16,0:09:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后以1  59的涨幅率收官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the premier ending at 1.59.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约证券交易所涨幅率达到1  23\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York Stock Exchange Index up 1.23,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收仓成交量达到1  64亿股\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}volume backing off a bit at 164 million shares.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白天纽约证券交易所\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Advances beat declines just about
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成交量继续持续走高\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}9-to-5 on the New York Stock Exchange.
