Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仅仅就在那小段时间里  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In just a moment's time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪去了  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.
