Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别他妈的惹恰吉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't fuck with the Chuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  天啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:03.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正中靶心\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bull's-eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.36,0:13:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像当年的欢乐时光\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like the good old days!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒死是最流行的最直接的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing like a strangulation to get the circulation going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是让我移魂出窍的仅存票根  安迪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my only ticket out of here, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就想从这个该死娃娃壳里出去\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to get out of this goddamn body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪呢  小混蛋  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you, you little shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(档案:安迪·巴克利 | 年龄:16周岁 | 被肯特军校录取)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(肯特军校)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向左向右  转\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inward, hut!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  加油  你一定行的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.Come on, yeah!You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  你行的  杰克逊  加油\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You can do it,Jackson, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错  继续  很好\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Move. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  继续向前  赶快\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.Yeah! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续前进  向终点进发\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get moving! Go to the end of the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:08.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到在过去的八年里\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see that for the past eight years
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被寄养在他人家庭中\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've been in one foster home after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,介意我知道原因么  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind if I ask why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.36,0:15:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把我从妈妈身边带走\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took me away from my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是  迫不得已而为之\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's ....under special care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说你怎么就不能安定在某个地方呢  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant how come you never got settled anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(男孩指认杀手附身"玩偶娃娃")
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换换环境\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adjustment problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:34.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认字  巴克利\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can read, Barclay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你口头回答\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和那些人在一起就从没舒服过\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never felt comfortable with those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不是我的家人  是陌生人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weren't family, they were strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  听着  巴克利\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, listen up, Barclay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很乐意修理修理你  因为你太不老实了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm willing to cut you some sack because you've had it so rough,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是到处惹麻烦\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you're a troublemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我正式接手了你这个小捣蛋鬼\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I got a real problem with troublemakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.32,0:16:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在军校捣乱可是不行的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't fit into the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:07.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你几条忠告\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So here's my advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.40,0:16:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长大点吧  你再也不是个孩子了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grow up, you're not a kid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候忘记那些杀手玩偶的幻想了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to forget these fantasies of killer dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.52,0:16:17.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  长官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"当我还是个孩子的时候  我像孩子一样的思考"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"When I was a child,I thought as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:28.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"但是当我成为男人时  我就远离了儿时的天真"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"But when I became a man,I put away childish things."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小新兵\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First Corinthians.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:33.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意口令  巴克利  起立\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look alive,Barclay, on your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在肯特军校  我们接收尿床的蠢蛋  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At Kent, we take bedwetters
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:37.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后把他们变成男人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and turn them into men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  不错  不错\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.56,0:16:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都能看到头皮了  是吧  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're seeing some skin now, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚吧  剪成光头了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Presto! You're bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:13.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始总会感觉有点怪异\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always feels a little weird at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:18.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一位\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:29.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和它吻别吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiss it goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吧  罗马人发明的大兵头\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the Romans invented the military cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把头发剪短了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To keep their hair short
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那在战争中敌人就无法抓头\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so their enemies couldn't grab ahold of it in battle
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后也无法割喉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and slit their throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  坐稳了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:03.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  该死\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们又回来了  我们比以往更卡哇伊了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're back,and we're better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人愿意和我玩\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one will play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  哦  有一位孤单的小伙伴\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-oh.There's a friend in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  振作点\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:22.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是好家伙\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a Good Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好家伙  好家伙  好家伙  好家伙\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good Guy! Good Guy! Good Guy! Good Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚刚从好家伙之家赶来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've just come from the Good Guy Clubhouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将永远成为你的小伙伴\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll be your friend till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做我小伙伴  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.88,0:18:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  嘚  吼\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hidey-h o!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  和我一起尽享高飞的乐趣吧  永远做你的小伙伴\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, all aboard for high-flying fun with me,your friend till the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:54.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来自"玩偶伙伴"的"好家伙"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Good Guy doll from Play Pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了吧  哥们\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:43.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吧  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.60,0:19:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杂碎们  狗杂碎们\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bastards! Fucking bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:46.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咋回事  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:47.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢尔顿  就是那帮狗杂碎\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shelton,that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:50.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢尔顿和他的屌丝小喽啰们\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shelton and his goddamn lackeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了  我没事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫安迪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定是新来的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be new.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然你不会不知道这里的规矩\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise you'd know they don't tolerate any form of individuality here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名字中"名"全部都是公开的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly nothing so personal as the first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:05.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  对  我忘了  我姓巴克利\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right, I forgot.Barclay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀特·赫斯特  档案上是哈洛德·奥布瑞\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whitehurst.Harold Aubrey for the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.80,0:20:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那  谢尔顿是谁  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, who's this Shelton?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军校助理  布雷特·C·谢尔顿上校\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cadet Lieutenant Colonel Brett C. Shelton.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里他就是上帝\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's God around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要幻想他会仁慈\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't expect any mercy from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:24.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到地狱  巴克利\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to hell, Barclay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:34.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体集合完毕  长官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All present and accounted for, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍息  埃尔斯少校\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Major Ellis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你新来的  是吧  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the new boy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉咋样  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 非常好  - 那就好\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pretty good. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说了你可以向我直视的  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said you could look at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我是谁么  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢尔顿  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shelton?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你来说是军校助理谢尔顿上校  混蛋\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Lieutenant Colonel Shelton to you, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军校助理谢尔顿上校\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Colonel Shelton.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对  是"军校助理谢尔顿上校"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Lieutenant Colonel Shelton,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"长官"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军校助理谢尔顿上校  长官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Colonel Shelton, sir.
