Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.72,0:35:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好把包裹打包好  巴克利\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better finish unpacking,Barclay.
