Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.84,0:48:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  我是恰吉  你一生相伴的好朋友\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, I'm Chucky.And I'm your friend to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.52,0:48:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿-嘚-吼\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hidey-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.52,0:48:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱死它了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.44,0:48:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的真名叫查尔斯·李·雷\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His real name is Charles Lee Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.48,0:48:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  是吗  口红给我\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, is that so? Give me your lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.00,0:48:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 干嘛  - 给我吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What for? - Just give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.56,0:48:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  给\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.44,0:48:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做什么呢  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.84,0:49:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧着吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.24,0:49:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  停下来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.76,0:49:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么样  小宝贝  - 别这样\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here you go,little baby! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.60,0:49:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会把它弄脏的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're messing him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.80,0:49:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  你太可爱了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.00,0:49:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别那么做  - 啊哦\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't do that! - Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.88,0:49:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  它看起来太傻了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't. He looks stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.88,0:49:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把他弄的和傻瓜一样\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're making him look like a wuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.68,0:49:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  看起来太美了  你干嘛呢  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he looks sweet.What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.32,0:49:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意点  有人来了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.84,0:49:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  赶紧撤\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.96,0:49:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  快撤  等等  等等\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.32,0:49:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等会  查尔斯怎么办  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! What about Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.44,0:49:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这简直是宣战\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This means war.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.16,0:50:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么回事  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.12,0:50:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢被拥抱\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to be hugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.84,0:51:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  你他妈的不是在耍我吧  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you got to be fucking kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.72,0:52:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙今晚还来回巡逻了两次\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man lives through two tours in Nam
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.72,0:52:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后现在就突然挂了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then one night he just drops dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.76,0:52:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有任何征兆\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.20,0:52:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跨立\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At ease!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.68,0:52:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谨此\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will now take a moment of silence
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.32,0:52:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向科克伦上尉默哀\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to honor Colonel Cochrane.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.68,0:52:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他生前如此和蔼  我们将终生怀念\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a fine man and he will be sorely missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.48,0:52:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,低头默哀\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bow your heads for prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.12,0:52:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就坐\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take seats!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.76,0:53:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔森  头发越来越长了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting pretty shaggy, Carison.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.44,0:53:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下周五过来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see you on Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.92,0:53:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  长官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.80,0:53:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周一  卷毛小子\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monday, Fabrizzio.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.40,0:53:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  长官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.32,0:53:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖孩子\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.16,0:53:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周二\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.40,0:53:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞅瞅你  怀特·赫斯特  你真他妈的丢脸\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you, Whitehurst.You're a disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.44,0:53:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次剪头是什么时候  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When's the last time you had a trim?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.64,0:53:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多两周前  长官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two weeks ago,Sergeant, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.28,0:53:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多  差不多  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think? You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.64,0:53:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃完早餐立刻去见我  明白不  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see you right after breakfast. You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.92,0:53:45.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  波尼克军士  长官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir,Sergeant Botnick, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.12,0:53:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你瞅什么呢  新兵蛋子  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are you looking at, new boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.88,0:53:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周三\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.08,0:54:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴克利  你干嘛去  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barclay,what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.36,0:54:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能胡来\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't just get up in the middle of mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.00,0:54:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.16,0:54:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少校\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.68,0:54:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肃静\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At ease!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.56,0:54:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰勒\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.76,0:54:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  巴克利  咋回事  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Barclay. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.40,0:54:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和你谈谈恰吉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta talk to you about Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.12,0:54:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说查尔斯\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.84,0:54:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见过他了么  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.48,0:54:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚以后就没见到过\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not since last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.92,0:54:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定藏起来了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hiding somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.04,0:54:44.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一知道你是自己一个人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna lay low till he knows you're alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.12,0:54:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会过来找你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then he's gonna come after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.32,0:54:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是想玩游戏\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just wants to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.48,0:54:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说  泰勒\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.76,0:54:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论他说什么  无论他向你承诺什么\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what he says,no matter what he promises you,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.28,0:54:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都要离他远远的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've got to stay away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.36,0:54:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要让他骗了你  他是坏人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him fool you.He's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.08,0:54:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查尔斯才不坏呢  他是好家伙\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charles isn't bad.He's a Good Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.64,0:54:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以替他担保\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says so on his shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.72,0:55:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他撒谎  泰勒\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lies, Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.44,0:55:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我  他是坏人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me,he's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.88,0:55:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已经伤害许多人了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hurt a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.32,0:55:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科克伦上尉就是被他害死得\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Colonel Cochrane was one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.56,0:55:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是嫉妒我  因为他是我的好朋友  而不是你的了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just jealous 'cause he's my best friend now,instead of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.84,0:55:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  你最好留着这个\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you better keep this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.12,0:55:23.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀特·赫斯特  你信不信\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whitehurst,you are without a doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.00,0:55:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最难维持的就是一个军人的仪表\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sorriest excuse for a soldier to ever disgrace these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.20,0:55:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对他  你这一辈子都别想消停\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Face it, you're not cut out for this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.40,0:55:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不帮我个忙\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you do yourself a favor
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.00,0:55:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出肯特军校呢  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get the hell out of Kent?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.00,0:55:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能帮我办到  我会的  长官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had any choice in the matter,I would, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.36,0:55:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小滑头\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.24,0:55:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚吧  剪成光头了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Presto! You're bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.84,0:56:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺爽\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.48,0:56:22.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么个事  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.88,0:56:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么进来的  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.68,0:56:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个发型明显不合格  大兵\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That haircut ain't regulation, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.88,0:56:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你上次剪头是什么时候  嗯  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When's the last time you had a trim, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.00,0:56:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和头发吻别吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiss it goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.20,0:57:25.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚吧  你挂了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Presto! You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.72,0:57:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错就是你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's definitely you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.56,0:57:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘了我的  我的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just forgot my... My...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.48,0:57:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘭\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.04,0:58:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年度军事演习\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The annual war games
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.44,0:58:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是肯特军校已经延续了五十年的传统\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have been an unbroken tradition here at Kent for over 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.04,0:58:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科克伦上尉一直坚信传统的价值\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Cochrane was a man who believed in the value of tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.00,0:58:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅仅是让我们延续下去而已\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He not only would have wanted us to go on,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.32,0:58:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是命令我们去传承\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'd have ordered us to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.76,0:58:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此  军事演习扔按原计划进行\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore, the war games will proceed as scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.04,0:58:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军校助理谢尔顿上校将带领蓝队\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Colonel Shelton will command the blue team.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.48,0:58:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛林少校带领红队\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major Rawlings will head up the reds.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.88,0:58:32.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任务目标很简单\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The objective is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.24,0:58:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是夺取对方的队旗\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To capture the other team's flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.76,0:58:37.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后安全的带回基地\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bring it back here safely to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.68,0:58:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛林\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rawlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.60,0:58:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发之前先到军械库领取武器\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will pick up your weapons in the armory before moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.52,0:58:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们会使用标准的0-3型爆花弹\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will be using the standard issue Springfield 0-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.60,0:58:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为弹药\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.88,0:58:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢尔顿\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shelton.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.92,0:59:10.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果被打中  就代表阵亡\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you get hit,you are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.12,0:59:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻回基地\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hike back to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.64,0:59:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两位指挥  管好你们的队伍\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cornmanders,take charge of your teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.68,0:59:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最强的队伍必胜\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the best team win.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.12,0:59:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝好运  各位\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.04,0:59:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎入队\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice of you to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.32,0:59:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来波尼克今天没让你好过\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like Botnick's in a pretty bad mood today.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.28,0:59:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.00,0:59:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  没啥事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. Nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.40,0:59:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  我很好  没事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing's wrong. I'm fine.Nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.00,1:00:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个会让疼痛大大减轻的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ought to slow the pricks down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.04,1:00:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一  一  一\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left! Left! Left!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.04,1:00:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次踏上征途\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* Here we go again *
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.04,1:00:24.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次踏上征途\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* Here we go again *
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.16,1:00:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着旧日的枪火\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* Same old stuff again *
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.16,1:00:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行军于大道之上\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* Marching down the avenue *
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.32,1:00:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向前两英里  胜利就在前方\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* Two more miles, we'll be through *
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.28,1:00:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会亲自征服你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* I'll be getting rid of you *
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.72,1:00:44.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着旧日的破枪火\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* Same old ugly stuff *
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.88,1:00:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次踏上征途\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* Here we go again *
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.16,1:00:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行军于大道之上\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* Marching down the avenue *
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.20,1:00:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向前一英里  胜利就在前方\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* One more miles, we'll be through *
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.28,1:01:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会亲自征服你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* I'll be getting rid of you *
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.84,1:01:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  怀特·赫斯特  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on,Whitehurst?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.16,1:01:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了  对不  你看到恰吉了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw something,didn't you? You saw Chucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.24,1:01:12.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别太懦弱了  怀特·赫斯特\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't wimp out on me now, Whitehurst.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.80,1:01:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助  那孩子也需要\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help.That kid needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.00,1:01:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都没看见  行不  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.84,1:01:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我压根就什么都没看见\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.60,1:01:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你滚吧  对的  你滚吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* You left, right,you left *
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.40,1:01:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你滚吧  对的  你滚吧\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* You left, right,you left *
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.48,1:01:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的军队滚蛋了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}* Your military left *
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.44,1:01:42.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃尔斯  一定要确定营地周围的安全\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellis, let's make sure the perimeters are secured.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.16,1:01:43.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  长官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.24,1:01:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她检查了所有的窗口\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She checks all the windows,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.96,1:01:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后保姆就听到嘭  嘭  嘭  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then the babysitter hears this thump, thump.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.68,1:01:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘭嘭嘭\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thumping.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.12,1:01:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像是什么东西在楼上在地板上拖着\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like something's being dragged across the floor upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.48,1:01:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然她想"我还没有检查孩子"\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And suddenly she thinks, "I haven't checked on the children."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.36,1:02:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后她就急忙上楼\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So she hurries to the top of the stairs,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.20,1:02:05.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后她到了楼上\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when she gets there,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.52,1:02:10.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她看到她的男朋友  被割断了手脚\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she sees her boyfriend,completely dismembered,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.80,1:02:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用下巴一点点的在地板上爬着\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dragging himself across the floor by his chin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.16,1:02:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘭  向前滑一下\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thump. Slide.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.40,1:02:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘭  向前滑一下\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thump. Slide.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.84,1:02:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘭  向前滑一下\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thump. Slide.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.16,1:02:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is gross.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.72,1:02:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿  伙计们  我有个好故事  而且是真的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you guys,I got a better story and it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.84,1:02:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是发生在精神病院的事\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about this mental institution,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.80,1:02:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离这里也没几英里\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's a few miles away from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.52,1:02:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.44,1:02:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望不是我的故事吓到了你\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope it wasn't something I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.08,1:02:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  抱歉\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.28,1:02:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德·斯尔娃  你认为红队的宿营地会是在哪呢  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}De Silva, where do you think the red team's camped out?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.76,1:02:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论在哪\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.92,1:03:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢尔顿都会找到的  他一直都这样\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shelton'll find them.He always does.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.68,1:03:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便说下  你可以叫我克里斯汀娜\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way,you can call me Kristin.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.28,1:03:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.80,1:03:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克里斯汀娜\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kristin.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.52,1:03:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的的名  你的呢  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my first name.Do you have one?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.24,1:03:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 安迪  - 啊\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Andy.- Huh
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.04,1:03:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  安迪  给你看点东西\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Andy,I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.04,1:03:31.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很酷吧  是吧  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.48,1:03:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.16,1:03:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都快忘了还有这种地方\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost forgot there were places like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.92,1:03:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只让人们感到快乐的地方\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People just go to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.96,1:03:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.76,1:03:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边有人\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.28,1:03:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是花鼠或者其他的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's probably just a chipmunk or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.92,1:03:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没啥能吓到你  是不  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing scares you,does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.40,1:03:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.92,1:04:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的  我真想从这娃娃身体里出去\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I really gotta get out of this body.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.24,1:04:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去找泰勒\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going after Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.52,1:04:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了吗  你找不到他的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy? You'll never find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.36,1:04:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赌点什么  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna bet?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.12,1:04:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从谢尔顿营房里偷的\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swiped this from Shelton's tent.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.96,1:04:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们扎营之前  他派出了一个侦察任务\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sent out a reconnaissance mission right before we pitched camp.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.84,1:04:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红队就在这附近\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The red team is somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.12,1:04:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子有危险  怀特·赫斯特\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That kid's a sitting duck,Whitehurst.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.48,1:04:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  你跟不跟我走  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, are you with me or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.12,1:04:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  不行\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.72,1:05:08.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒吧  小姐们  我们出发了\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up and at 'em, ladies,we're moving out!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.20,1:05:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五分钟之内  我要让这个营地成空营\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want this camp to be a ghost town in five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.68,1:05:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黎明在出发吧  长官\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we weren't going until dawn, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.20,1:05:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人从上尉帐篷里偷走了战术地图\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone stole the reconnaissance map out of the Colonel's tent,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.68,1:05:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此我们必须要转移\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we're making our move now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.80,1:05:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去准备吧  汉利\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get going, Hanley.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.48,1:05:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀特·赫斯特\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whitehurst.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.44,1:05:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地图被偷了你浑然不觉  是吧  \N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't know anything about a missing map,would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.40,1:05:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个混蛋巴克利呢  怀特·赫斯特\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell's Barclay? Whitehurst!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.80,1:05:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢尔顿上校  你最好过来看看\N{\fncronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Shelton,you'd better have a look in here, sir.
